@*
    [REFACTOR:Week1:Task1.3] PortraitWarning Component
    Reusable portrait orientation warning overlay for mobile/tablet devices
    Eliminates ~60 lines of duplicated markup across 3 components
    
    Features:
    - Full-screen purple gradient overlay
    - Animated icon with pulse effect
    - Responsive message card
    - CSS-based visibility control via media query
    
    Usage: Automatically shown on mobile/tablet in portrait mode
    Hidden: Desktop and landscape orientation
    
    Created: November 25, 2025
    Refactoring Plan: CANVAS-REFACTORING-PLAN.md (Week 1, Task 1.3)
*@

<!-- [FEATURE:canvas-receivers] Portrait Orientation Overlay - Mobile & Tablet Only ;CLEANUP_OK -->
<div class="canvas-portrait-overlay">
    <div class="canvas-portrait-message-card">
        <i class="fas fa-mobile-screen-button fa-rotate-90 canvas-portrait-icon"></i>
        <h2 class="canvas-portrait-heading">Landscape Mode Required</h2>
        <p class="canvas-portrait-text">
            Please rotate your device to landscape orientation for the best viewing experience.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    // No code-behind needed - all behavior controlled by CSS media queries in canvas-shared.css
    // Component is stateless and purely presentational
}
